000000033\": {\n\"cc\": 2,\n\"ci\": 1668246628,\n\"ty\": 0,\n\"la\": 0,\n\"co\": 1,\n\"ss\": true,\n\"sg\": 0,\n\"lt\": 0,\n\"lw\": 0,\n\"lc\": 0,\n\"cs\": [ ]\n}\n},\n\"bi\": [ ],\n\"bidt\": { }\n}--></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">금오공과대학교 평생교육원에서&nbsp; </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">「2022년도 경북도민행복대학 구미캠퍼스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">」 신입생을 다음과 같이 모집합니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">구미시민 여러분의 많은 관심과 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">□ 교육대상 : 구미시민 (만30세~59세) 50명</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">□ 교육장소 : 금오공과대학교 평생교육원 (금오공대 신평동캠퍼스)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">□ 교육과정 : 공통+특화과정(7대영역)&nbsp;&nbsp;</spa