-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">□ 수 강 료 : 무료 (재료비 등 본인부담) </span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">□ 문&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 의 : 054-478-7226 ~ 7227</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwejCFkBUBCBJAUgdQHYAUC2B5ASwE0AvGAMQQEMsAJAGwDoArABwHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">